    "_postman_id": "11892384-84c0-479e-abaf-aa5aeb4ff405",
    "name": "Todo App",
    "description": "This collection covers the full CRUD lifecycle for a Todo API running locally at `http://localhost:8300/api/todos`. It contains five requests:\n\n- **add todo** — `POST /api/todos`: Creates a new todo item. The request body includes a `title` (string) and a `completed` flag (boolean, defaults to `false`).\n- **list todo** — `GET /api/todos`: Retrieves all existing todo items.\n- **list by id** — `GET /api/todos/:id`: Fetches a single todo item by its ID.\n- **update todo** — `PUT /api/todos/:id`: Updates an existing todo item. The request body accepts a `title` and a `completed` flag to mark the item as done.\n- **delete todo** — `DELETE /api/todos/:id`: Permanently removes a todo item by its ID.\n\nUse this collection to develop, test, and validate the Todo API endpoints during local development.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
